= Energy Usage Coaching via Lightweight Pattern Mining
== Abstract
We present a small-scale coaching tool that analyzes usage patterns and recommends interventions with estimated impact. The workflow integrates automated reporting and reproducible evaluation.

== Method
Cluster usage profiles and map to recommendation templates with estimated savings.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
